  "title": {
    "type": "text",
    "$t": "結婚講好話（三）"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span><b>作者：</b></span></span><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b>楊忠憲</b></span></p><div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">雙人約會後壁溝<span style=\"white-space: pre;\"><br /></span>『帥哥』講話口才gâu&nbsp;<br />101大樓是阮兜<br />阮厝田園tī水頭</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">園內瑪瑙（bé-ló）做石頭<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>玉石花磚鋪真厚<br />沙金提來做齒膏<br />房間金塊做枕頭</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">豪華遊艇靠碼頭<span style=\"white-space: pre;\"><br /></span>Biàn-lù代步sì-kè走<br />飛機世界遊透透<br />風吹錢票隨風飄</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">璇石提來sì-kè拋<span style=\"white-space: pre;\"><br /></span>美金台票khai bē了<span style=\"white-space: pre;\"><br /></span>金銀珠寶用布包<span style=\"white-space: pre;\"><br /></span>huah聲奴才馬上到</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span>早睏uànn起到中晝<span style=\"white-space: pre;\"><br /></span>嫁入門做少奶奶<span style=\"white-space: pre;\">    </span>雙跤翹<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span></span>山珍海味真好料<span style=\"white-space: pre;\"><br /></span>燕窩補身食bē老</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">『帥哥』面皮生真厚<span style=\"white-space: pre;\"><br /></span>甜言蜜語sueh透透<span style=\"white-space: pre;\"><br /></span>人又生做真緣投<br />莫怪新娘拐leh走&nbsp;</span></p><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br /></div><span></span><span><a name='more'></a></span><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEiNeqwE3U0oB1mUBDI0gnHN3RGpX3bBDNxwYmhC6It7bnGp-3QRmIAQYbPNQUQug3GtMLh8guRpe026fruzQ-JEw9yUfq0yy4lAIxjf_2zav957dUFXa4ff70YmaE2AoFP60wjqwyMP8hCGcwZp3V8DbiE21PMCt8dPdeoJRGZTi2fz6c5QflfgWkjNXi5w/s3036/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1360%E6%9C%9F_015_B.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"3036\" data-original-width=\"2150\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEiNeqwE3U0oB1mUBDI0gnHN3RGpX3bBDNxwYmhC6It7bnGp-3QRmIAQYbPNQUQug3GtMLh8guRpe026fruzQ-JEw9yUfq0yy4lAIxjf_2zav957dUFXa4ff70YmaE2AoFP60wjqwyMP8hCGcwZp3V8DbiE21PMCt8dPdeoJRGZTi2fz6c5QflfgWkjNXi5w/w454-h640/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1360%E6%9C%9F_015_B.jpg\" width=\"454\" /></a></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgzsBKy7iCDt_5JXdK1Bp1gVoNni83EghB61BJG4NVhbUZg7PmnxgBLipSs1XnIQ_cm_xtsTh6OqogEVF_Sh0FaiE0KbF6eemWGUaSdI5WOlvKQH-B4-CK-0UsjCEw86m0VnR3OnM7ESWn9XWSrakC6L3DpAiIcJ5aMM4ItAqVHaN8UBR3D5fY1y5XvYPQM/s1424/360%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1_%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1424\" data-original-width=\"1000\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgzsBKy7iCDt_5JXdK1Bp1gVoNni83EghB61BJG4NVhbUZg7PmnxgBLipSs1XnIQ_cm_xtsTh6OqogEVF_Sh0FaiE0KbF6eemWGUaSdI5WOlvKQH-B4-CK-0UsjCEw86m0VnR3OnM7ESWn9XWSrakC6L3DpAiIcJ5aMM4ItAqVHaN8UBR3D5fY1y5XvYPQM/w450-h640/360%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1_%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2.jpg\" width=\"450\" /></a></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><b>#來唸七字仔&nbsp;專欄，本文使用教育部推薦漢字kap台羅。</b><br /><br /></span></div><div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"color: #38761d; font-size: medium;\"><b><span style=\"background-color: white; font-family: inherit; text-align: left;